+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

================================================================================
【7】API 端点规划
================================================================================
POST   /api/logs              - 创建日志（支持文件上传）
GET    /api/logs              - 获取日志列表（分页、筛选、搜索）
GET    /api/logs/{id}         - 获取单条日志详情
PUT    /api/logs/{id}         - 更新日志
DELETE /api/logs/{id}         - 删除单条日志
DELETE /api/logs              - 批量删除日志
POST   /api/logs/{id}/diagnose - 一键诊断
GET    /api/dashboard/stats    - 仪表盘统计数据

================================================================================
【8】数据模型设计
================================================================================
LogEntry:
  - id: str (UUID)
  - content: str
  - exception_type: str
  - severity: str (LOW/MEDIUM/HIGH/CRITICAL)
  - occurred_at: datetime (optional)
  - service_name: str (optional)
  - stack_trace: str (optional)
  - user_id: str (optional)
  - created_at: datetime
  - updated_at: datetime

Diagnosis:
  - id: str (UUID)
  - log_id: str (FK)
  - root_cause: str
  - solution: str
  - severity_assessment: str
  - similar_logs: List[str]
  - created_at: datetime

